---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Contact
description: "How to reach Mark Scott and Aaron Scott of Scott's Models."
navKey: contact
bodyClass: contact
permalink: /contact.html
---
{%- from "partials/macros.njk" import ext %}
<div class="wrap">
  <header class="page-head">
    <h1>Contact</h1>
    <p class="lead">For questions about a project, collaboration, or anything else, reach either of us directly through the profiles below.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="contact-grid">
    {%- for person in people %}
    <section class="contact-card" aria-labelledby="c-{{ person.id }}">
      <h2 id="c-{{ person.id }}">{{ person.name }}</h2>
      <p class="contact-card__focus">{{ person.focus }}</p>
      <ul class="contact-list">
        {%- if person.email %}
        <li><span class="contact-list__kind">Email</span><a href="mailto:{{ person.email }}">{{ person.email }}</a></li>
        {%- endif %}
        {%- for l in person.links %}
        <li><span class="contact-list__kind">{{ l.label }}</span>{{ ext(l.url, l.handle or (l.url | replace("https://", "") | replace("www.", ""))) }}</li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
    </section>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>

  <section class="section-block" aria-labelledby="where-h">
    <h2 id="where-h">Best way to reach us</h2>
    <div class="two-col">
      <p>For anything about a specific project, include the project name so it reaches whichever of us owns it. You can find every project and its status on the <a href="{{ '/projects.html' | rel }}">projects page</a>.</p>
      <p>Mark's personal website, including his research and CV, stays separate from this site and is linked above.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
